नागकेशर = नागकेसर
(1) MESUA FERREA LINN. (Avk; Bpn, p. 229-232; Chopra; Dgm, p.
226; Dgv, nr. 38; Dutt; DWH 1, p. 170-172; HK; Kav; KB 1, p.
274-276; Na 1, nr. 43; Nadk. 1, nr. 1595; Roxb., p. 437; Sanyal; Vśs)
= M. COROMANDELINA WIGHT (Dgm, p. 226; KB 1, p. 274-276; Nadk.
1, nr. 1595) = M. PEDUNCULATA WIGHT (KB 1, p. 274-276) = M. ROX-
BURGHII WIGHT (Dgm, p. 226; HK; MW; Nadk. 1, nr. 1595; PW) =
M. SPECIOSA CHOISY (KB 1, p. 274-276);
(2) OCHROCARPUS LONGIFOLIUS BENTH. ET HOOK. F. EX T. ANDERS.
(Bpn, p. 229-232; DWH 1, p. 172-173; KB 1, p. 269-270; Na 1, nr.
44; Nadk. 1, nr. 1731);
(3) CALOPHYLLUM INOPHYLLUM LINN. (Bpn, p. 229-232);
(4) = नागदमनी (Vśs);
(5) the immature fruit of CINNAMOMUM CASSIA BLUME (DWH 3, p.
210; Dy, p. 670);
(6) the immature fruit of C. INERS REINW. EX BLUME (DWH 3, p.
210; Dy, p. 670);
(7) the buds of C. ZEYLANICUM NEES = LAURUS CASSIA LINN.
(Ainslie 1, p. 60).

